# 🐉 DexLang & DexIDE — The Beast Language & IDE  
A custom programming language and GUI IDE built from scratch by **snehith**.

DexLang is a tiny but powerful interpreted language.  
DexIDE is a full GUI editor with build tools, output logs, and project management.

This repo is where the magic happens.  
Welcome to the beast. 🧪🔥

---

## 🚀 Features

### 🧠 DexLang (The Language)
- ✅ Integer variables  
- ✅ Arithmetic operations  
- ✅ While loops  
- ✅ If / Else  
- ✅ Print  
- ✅ Block scopes `{ ... }`  
- ✅ Simple interpreter  
- ✅ Easy to extend  

### 🖥️ DexIDE (The Beast IDE)
- 📂 Open / Save `.dex` files  
- ▶️ Run DexLang code  
- 🏗️ Build system with:
  - `.dex-output/`
  - `.dex-output/program.dex`
  - `.dex-output/lastBuild.log`
  - `.dex-output/lastRun.txt`
  - `.dex-output/.dexDump/` (history of all builds)
- 🧾 Console output  
- 🎨 Clean Swing UI  

